416 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 212 0 R
/T (Starting with one of the most active and comprehensive regional organizations, ASEAN, its history and limitations speak to the difficult terrain that many multilateral institutions in Asia must navigate \(Nair, 2019\). From being created as a front against the spread of communism in 1967, by the Philippines, Indonesia, Malaysia, Singapore, Thailand and Vietnam, it has since moved away from any ideological orientation and added Brunei, Cambodia, Laos and Myanmar as members. Although it covers many aspects of cooperation, its most active work is on economic interaction and trade. This include overseeing the ASEAN Free Trade Area and various agreements with additional partners, like the mentioned Chiang Mai Initiative, which also involves China, Japan, and South Korea, that are countries to which ASEAN maintains especially close ties \(Goh, 2007\). ASEAN is host to several discussion forums, in which both regional and global partners participate, including the EU, which in 2015 established a designated Delegation to ASEAN in Jakarta, where the ASEAN secretariat is based \(EU, 2022\). )
/E (Starting with one of the most active and comprehensive regional organizations, ASEAN, its history and limitations speak to the difficult terrain that many multilateral institutions in Asia must navigate \(Nair, 2019\). From being created as a front against the spread of communism in 1967, by the Philippines, Indonesia, Malaysia, Singapore, Thailand and Vietnam, it has since moved away from any ideological orientation and added Brunei, Cambodia, Laos and Myanmar as members. Although it covers many aspects of cooperation, its most active work is on economic interaction and trade. This include overseeing the ASEAN Free Trade Area and various agreements with additional partners, like the mentioned Chiang Mai Initiative, which also involves China, Japan, and South Korea, that are countries to which ASEAN maintains especially close ties \(Goh, 2007\). ASEAN is host to several discussion forums, in which both regional and global partners participate, including the EU, which in 2015 established a designated Delegation to ASEAN in Jakarta, where the ASEAN secretariat is based \(EU, 2022\). )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6 7]
>>
