611 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 227 0 R
/T (After the creation of the AU in 2002, the EU started establishing ties with the new organization with the ambition to begin a more equal partnership away from donor-recipient dynamics \(Carbone, 2023\). These ties started with the EU-Africa summits in 2000 which in 2017 became the high-level EU-AU summits in recognition of the increased centrality of the AU. They serve to define the framework of the relationship and maintain the political dialogue.)
/E (After the creation of the AU in 2002, the EU started establishing ties with the new organization with the ambition to begin a more equal partnership away from donor-recipient dynamics \(Carbone, 2023\). These ties started with the EU-Africa summits in 2000 which in 2017 became the high-level EU-AU summits in recognition of the increased centrality of the AU. They serve to define the framework of the relationship and maintain the political dialogue.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
