625 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 228 0 R
/T (In particular, important disagreements on key questions of the role and functioning of global organizations have hampered progress. This includes disagreement on relating to the the International Criminal Court, reform of the UN Security Council, responses to migration,[8] the availability of Covid-19 vaccines, sexual rights and human rights promotion, and funding of climate change efforts \(Carbone, 2023; Mattheis et al., 2023; Maglia, Brosig & Karlsrud, 2024\). These issues reveal significant differences between the EU and African states, indicating that global political questions impact on regional cooperation, which combine with the persistence of asymmetry and donor-recipient logics to hamper inter-regional \(Kell & Vines, 2021\).)
/E (In particular, important disagreements on key questions of the role and functioning of global organizations have hampered progress. This includes disagreement on relating to the the International Criminal Court, reform of the UN Security Council, responses to migration,[8] the availability of Covid-19 vaccines, sexual rights and human rights promotion, and funding of climate change efforts \(Carbone, 2023; Mattheis et al., 2023; Maglia, Brosig & Karlsrud, 2024\). These issues reveal significant differences between the EU and African states, indicating that global political questions impact on regional cooperation, which combine with the persistence of asymmetry and donor-recipient logics to hamper inter-regional \(Kell & Vines, 2021\).)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
