/T ([7] For Brazil, the websites of the Presidency \(http://www.biblioteca.presidencia.gov.br/, https://www.gov.br/planalto/\) and the Ministry of Foreign Affairs \(https://www.gov.br/mre/\). For India, the websites of the Prime Minister \(https://www.pmindia.gov.in/\) and the Ministry for External Affairs \(https://www.mea.gov.in\). For Indonesia, the websites of the Presidency \(https://www.presidenri.go.id\), the Cabinet Secretariat \(https://setkab.go.id/\), and the Ministry of Foreign Affairs \(https://kemlu.go.id/\). For Nigeria, few speeches were available on the State House website \(http://statehouse.gov.ng\). For South Africa, the websites of the government \(https://www.gov.za/news\), the Presidency \(https://www.presidency.gov.za\), and the Minister of International Relations and Cooperation \(https://www.dirco.gov.za\).)
/E ([7] For Brazil, the websites of the Presidency \(http://www.biblioteca.presidencia.gov.br/, https://www.gov.br/planalto/\) and the Ministry of Foreign Affairs \(https://www.gov.br/mre/\). For India, the websites of the Prime Minister \(https://www.pmindia.gov.in/\) and the Ministry for External Affairs \(https://www.mea.gov.in\). For Indonesia, the websites of the Presidency \(https://www.presidenri.go.id\), the Cabinet Secretariat \(https://setkab.go.id/\), and the Ministry of Foreign Affairs \(https://kemlu.go.id/\). For Nigeria, few speeches were available on the State House website \(http://statehouse.gov.ng\). For South Africa, the websites of the government \(https://www.gov.za/news\), the Presidency \(https://www.presidency.gov.za\), and the Minister of International Relations and Cooperation \(https://www.dirco.gov.za\).)
