/T (Ole Jacob Sending is Director of Research and Research Professor at the Norwegian Institute of International Affairs. His research interests include the character of global governance arrangements, the changing form of state sovereignty, and the evolving features of power politics. His research on global governance focuses on the role of expertise, the dynamics of authority constitution, and the nexus between public and private actors. send42ole@nupi.no)
