/T (Cristiana Maglia is Senior Research Fellow at the Norwegian Institute of International Affairs. She is currently the post-doctoral researcher of the project Ad hoc crisis response and international organizations \(ADHOCISM\), funded by the Research Council of Norway. At NUPI, she also worked in the LORAX and Market for Anarchy projects. cristiana.maglia@nupi.no)
