/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 215 0 R
/T (Finally, if expanding the focus to forums and activities based on regular interaction but less structural, organizational resources, the list of Asian regional organization turns expansive. If various types of trade agreements, backed up with some organizational resources, are included, plus security-related mechanisms involving regional and other international partners, the number naturally grows further \(Panke et al., 2022\). All in all, Asia is home to a multitude of organizations, but while many serve vital functions in fostering economic cooperation, all remain relatively weak when it comes to effectively addressing or agreeing on political issues that involve contested interests, of which there are many within and across the geographical areas that make up the vast Asia region.)
/E (Finally, if expanding the focus to forums and activities based on regular interaction but less structural, organizational resources, the list of Asian regional organization turns expansive. If various types of trade agreements, backed up with some organizational resources, are included, plus security-related mechanisms involving regional and other international partners, the number naturally grows further \(Panke et al., 2022\). All in all, Asia is home to a multitude of organizations, but while many serve vital functions in fostering economic cooperation, all remain relatively weak when it comes to effectively addressing or agreeing on political issues that involve contested interests, of which there are many within and across the geographical areas that make up the vast Asia region.)
/Pg 20 0 R
>>
