/P 232 0 R
/T (There is significant variation between regions in the investment in regional organizations. In Europe, the EU is becoming more important. Looking outside of Europe, the African Union is where there have been most investment. ASEAN is also an important arena, but with more focus on diplomacy. Latin America is arguably the region with least support for regional organizations.)
/E (There is significant variation between regions in the investment in regional organizations. In Europe, the EU is becoming more important. Looking outside of Europe, the African Union is where there have been most investment. ASEAN is also an important arena, but with more focus on diplomacy. Latin America is arguably the region with least support for regional organizations.)
/Pg 37 0 R
>>
